  "name": "The Best Post-Workout Shake",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "This is the best post-workout protein shake. Made with almond milk, banana, whey protein powder, frozen berries, and peanut butter, it's a delicious treat.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Layer protein powder, flax meal, cocoa powder, and brown sugar in a blender. Add almond milk, frozen berries, banana, and peanut butter. Blend until smooth, about 1 minute."
    }
